        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sundubu jjigae features "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "sundubu ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "sundubu"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", a very soft silken tofu that breaks into irregular clouds in the broth. The stew is eaten directly from the pot or poured over rice. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The deep red colour comes from "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gochugaru",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "gochugaru"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " chilli flakes sauteed in oil at the start. This blooms their colour and flavour before the liquid is added."
          }
        ]
      },
